        {
          "text": "But love",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3975
        },
        {
          "text": "love was always there. Before I even met you.” The last part makes no sense at all",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3984
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Lavina Theron, I have sailed the seas searching for you for my entire life",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6712
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The lines continue down his flesh, snaking over veins and scars until they split in the exact same way as mine around bo",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7431
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I am looking at a mirror of something that has plagued me, challenged me, controlled me for my entire existence",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7574
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Draven is my Marked Match",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7687
        }
      ],
      "words": 5
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You were breaking me! I felt like I was betraying him—you",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8587
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You were the one who came into my sister’s chambers?” Rage fills me. “You are the reason for the heightened security?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9273
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I would have chosen you anyway, Draven Artrayu.” I say it with my head held high—not masking the hurt—and still crying",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9900
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I’m going to burn him alive.” The rage sits—no, it bubbles out of me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10392
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    }
  ],
